SUMMARY:The Little Mermen & The Princess Pals: Disney Sing Along The Ultima
 te Disney Tribute Band
LOCATION:Colonial Theatre\, 111 South St\, Pittsfield\, MA 01201
DESCRIPTION:Recognized around the world as the #1 Disney tribute band—pra
 ised by Disney\, ABC News\, and more—The Little Mermen bring Disney’s 
 most beloved songs to life with a rock-infused twist. Known for their high
 -energy performances\, dazzling costumes\, and Broadway-caliber vocals\, t
 he band delivers a nostalgic\, joy-filled journey through a century of Dis
 ney magic\, from Mary Poppins and The Lion King to modern favorites like F
 rozen and Moana\nhttps://www.berkshiretheatregroup.org/calendar/\nFrom Pus
 hpin Western Mass: https://pushpin.city/westernma/
